  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Thrives: Reducing Child Labor in Ethiopian Agriculture Using a Gender Focused Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The She Thrives project seeks to build agency of vulnerable women and girls in the Ethiopian agricultural sector, change community social norms and traditions that uphold child labor and gender inequality, and transform structures (including laws, policies and institutions) to be more gender equitable and support efforts to reduce child labor in Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
